flowchart TD

    PROD[Production]
    BACKUP[Backup Service]
    STORE[Protected Backup Store]
    IMMUTABLE[Immutable / Isolated Copy]
    RECOVERY[Recovery Environment]
    VALIDATE[Integrity Validation]
    RESTORE[Trusted Restore]

    PROD --> BACKUP
    BACKUP --> STORE
    STORE --> IMMUTABLE

    IMMUTABLE --> RECOVERY
    RECOVERY --> VALIDATE
    VALIDATE --> RESTORE
